# Store every text file with LF in the repository, whatever the working copy
# uses. Notes, CSS, JS and the build scripts then behave identically on Windows,
# macOS and the GitHub Actions runner.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Raster and container formats git must never line-ending convert.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.webp binary
*.avif binary
*.ico binary
*.pdf binary
*.zip binary
*.pcap binary
*.woff2 binary
